  {
   "id": "r087",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4240,
   "src": "22.2.3.2 con 20.2.2.1: acero elastoplástico, acotado a ±f_y."
  },
  {
   "id": "r088",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4288,
   "src": "f_s(c, d_i) := min(max(E_s*eps_s(c, d_i), -f_y), f_y)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r089",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4320,
   "src": "Fuerza de una capa. Si la capa cae DENTRO del bloque comprimido se descuenta el"
  },
  {
   "id": "r090",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4368,
   "src": "hormigón desplazado (0,85f'c), que es lo que hace consistente el barrido con la"
  },
  {
   "id": "r091",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4416,
   "src": "Ec. (22.4.2.2): con c → ∞ la suma reproduce P_o."
  },
  {
   "id": "r092",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4464,
   "src": "F_s(c, d_i, A_si) :=\n    a := min(beta_1*c, h)\n    f_si := f_s(c, d_i)\n    if d_i <= a\n        f_si := f_si - k_bloque*f_c\n    return A_si*f_si"
  },
  {
   "id": "r093",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4592,
   "src": "22.2.2.4.1: bloque de compresión del hormigón, acotado al canto de la sección."
  },
  {
   "id": "r094",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4640,
   "src": "C_c(c) :=\n    a := min(beta_1*c, h)\n    return k_bloque*f_c*a*b"
  },
  {
   "id": "r095",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4720,
   "src": "22.2.1.1 · equilibrio de fuerzas: P_n(c) = C_c + Σ F_si."
  },
  {
   "id": "r096",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4768,
   "src": "P_n(c) :=\n    return C_c(c) + F_s(c, d_1, A_s1) + F_s(c, d_2, A_s2) + F_s(c, d_3, A_s3)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r097",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4832,
   "src": "Equilibrio de momentos respecto del centroide de la sección (h/2, simétrica)."
  },
  {
   "id": "r098",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4880,
   "src": "M_n(c) :=\n    a := min(beta_1*c, h)\n    M := C_c(c)*(h/2 - a/2)\n    M := M + F_s(c, d_1, A_s1)*(h/2 - d_1)\n    M := M + F_s(c, d_2, A_s2)*(h/2 - d_2)\n    M := M + F_s(c, d_3, A_s3)*(h/2 - d_3)\n    return M"
  },
  {
   "id": "r099",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5040,
   "src": "Con c muy grande toda la sección está comprimida y la suma tiene que reproducir"
  },
  {
   "id": "r100",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5088,
   "src": "la Ec. (22.4.2.2). Es lo que ata el barrido al ancla 1 y lo que justifica el"
  },
  {
   "id": "r101",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5136,
   "src": "descuento del hormigón desplazado:"
  },
  {
   "id": "v008",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5184,
   "src": "abs(P_n(4*h) - P_o) < 0.05 tonf ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r103",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5232,
   "src": "Fig. R21.2.2a: ε_t es la deformación NETA DE TRACCIÓN de la capa extrema, d_3."
  },
  {
   "id": "r104",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5280,
   "src": "eps_t(c) := eps_cu*(d_3 - c)/c"
  },
  {
   "id": "r105",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5344,
   "src": "━━ 6 · ANCLA 2 · PUNTO BALANCEADO ━━",
   "pageBreak": true
  },
  {
   "id": "r106",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5392,
   "src": "El hormigón llega a ε_cu y la capa extrema a ε_ty a la vez. De la compatibilidad:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r107",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5440,
   "src": "c_bal := eps_cu/(eps_cu + eps_ty)*d = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r108",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5488,
   "src": "P_nb := P_n(c_bal) = tonf"
  },
  {
   "id": "r109",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5536,
   "src": "M_nb := M_n(c_bal) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r110",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5584,
   "src": "Tabla 21.2.2(b): en ε_t = ε_ty la sección es controlada por compresión, φ = 0,65."
  },
  {
   "id": "r111",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5632,
   "src": "Rd_Pb := phi_cc*P_nb = tonf"
  },
  {
   "id": "r112",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5680,
   "src": "Rd_Mb := phi_cc*M_nb = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r113",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5744,
   "src": "━━ 7 · φ A LO LARGO DE LA CURVA (Tabla 21.2.2 y 21.2.2.3) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r114",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5792,
   "src": "Tabla 21.2.2, columna «Other»: 0,65 hasta ε_ty, transición lineal hasta"
  },
  {
   "id": "r115",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5840,
   "src": "ε_ty + 0,003, y 0,90 de ahí en adelante. En 318-25 el umbral es ε_ty + 0,003,"
  },
  {
   "id": "r116",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5888,
   "src": "no el 0,005 fijo de antes de 2019."
  },
  {
   "id": "r117",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5936,
   "src": "eps_tc := eps_ty + 0.003 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r118",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5984,
   "src": "phi_tab(c) :=\n    e_t := eps_t(c)\n    if e_t <= eps_ty\n        return 0.65\n    else if e_t >= eps_tc\n        return 0.90\n    else\n        return 0.65 + 0.25*(e_t - eps_ty)/0.003"
  },
  {
   "id": "r119",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6160,
   "src": "La tabla tampoco termina en la tabla: 21.2.2.3 acota ese φ por interpolación"
  },
  {
   "id": "r120",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6208,
   "src": "lineal en P_n entre 0,90 en 0,1f'c·A_g y φ_cc en P_n,bal. Es un requisito de"
  },
  {
   "id": "r121",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6256,
   "src": "318-19 en adelante y solo puede BAJAR el φ de la tabla."
  },
  {
   "id": "r122",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6304,
   "src": "P_lo := 0.1*f_c*A_g = tonf"
  },
  {
   "id": "r123",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6352,
   "src": "R21.2.2: si P_n,bal < 0,1f'c·A_g, 21.2.2.3 no aplica. Acá sí aplica:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r124",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6400,
   "src": "c_2123_aplica := P_nb > P_lo ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r125",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6448,
   "src": "phi_lim(Pn) :=\n    if Pn < P_lo\n        return 0.90\n    else if Pn > P_nb\n        return phi_cc\n    else\n        return 0.90 + (phi_cc - 0.90)*(Pn - P_lo)/(P_nb - P_lo)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r126",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6608,
   "src": "phi_c(c) := min(phi_tab(c), phi_lim(P_n(c)))"
  },
  {
   "id": "r127",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6672,
   "src": "━━ 8 · ANCLA 3 · FLEXIÓN PURA (P_n = 0) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r128",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6720,
   "src": "No hay fórmula cerrada: se busca el c que anula P_n por bisección. P_n crece con"
  },
  {
   "id": "r129",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6768,
   "src": "c, así que el intervalo [0,5 cm; d] encierra la raíz."
  },
  {
   "id": "r130",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6816,
   "src": "c_0 :=\n    lo := 0.5 cm\n    hi := d\n    for i in 1:60\n        mid := (lo + hi)/2\n        if P_n(mid) > 0 tonf\n            hi := mid\n        else\n            lo := mid\n    return (lo + hi)/2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r131",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7024,
   "src": "c_0 = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "v009",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7072,
   "src": "abs(P_n(c_0)) < 0.01 tonf ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r133",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7120,
   "src": "M_0 := M_n(c_0) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r134",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7168,
   "src": "eps_t0 := eps_t(c_0) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r135",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7216,
   "src": "phi_0 := phi_c(c_0) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r136",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7264,
   "src": "Con P_n = 0 < 0,1f'c·A_g el tope de 21.2.2.3 no muerde, y ε_t supera ε_ty+0,003:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r137",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7312,
   "src": "la sección es controlada por tracción y φ = 0,90."
  },
  {
   "id": "v010",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7360,
   "src": "phi_0 == 0.90 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r139",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7408,
   "src": "Rd_M0 := phi_0*M_0 = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r140",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7472,
   "src": "━━ 9 · EL BARRIDO: LA FRONTERA COMPLETA ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r141",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7520,
   "src": "Cada posición del eje neutro da un punto (φM_n, φP_n). Se barre c desde la"
  },
  {
   "id": "r142",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7568,
   "src": "flexión pura hasta que φP_n alcanza el tope Rd_P, que corta la punta frágil."
  },
  {
   "id": "r143",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7616,
   "src": "n_pasos := 160"
  },
  {
   "id": "r144",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7664,
   "src": "c_fin := 2*h"
  },
  {
   "id": "r145",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7712,
   "src": "curva :=\n    acc := [[0, 0]]\n    for i in 0:n_pasos\n        c := c_0 + (c_fin - c_0)*i/n_pasos\n        phi := phi_c(c)\n        Pd := phi*P_n(c)\n        Md := phi*M_n(c)\n        if Pd > Rd_P\n            break\n        acc := concat(acc, [[Md/(1 tonf*m), Pd/(1 tonf)]], 1)\n    acc := concat(acc, [[0, Rd_P/(1 tonf)]], 1)\n    return acc[2:end, 1:2]"
  },
  {
   "id": "r146",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7968,
   "src": "n_curva := size(curva)[1]"
  },
  {
   "id": "r147",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8016,
   "src": "La curva arranca en la flexión pura y cierra sobre el tope. Los dos extremos se"
  },
  {
   "id": "r148",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8064,
   "src": "contrastan contra los anclas calculadas aparte: si no coinciden, el barrido"
  },
  {
   "id": "r149",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8112,
   "src": "corre al revés o la escala está mal."
  },
  {
   "id": "v011",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8160,
   "src": "abs(curva[1,1]*1 tonf*m - Rd_M0) < 0.01 tonf*m ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v012",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8208,
   "src": "abs(curva[1,2]) < 0.01 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v013",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8256,
   "src": "abs(curva[n_curva,2]*1 tonf - Rd_P) < 0.01 tonf ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r153",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8304,
   "src": "Y el barrido tiene que subir monótono en φP_n: es lo que autoriza a buscar por"
  },
  {
   "id": "r154",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8352,
   "src": "bisección el punto de la frontera que acompaña a cada P_u."
  },
  {
   "id": "r155",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8400,
   "src": "sube :=\n    ok := 1\n    for i in 2:(n_curva - 1)\n        if curva[i,2] < curva[i-1,2]\n            ok := 0\n    return ok"
  },
  {
   "id": "v014",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8528,
   "src": "sube == 1 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r157",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8576,
   "src": "El momento de diseño máximo de la frontera y dónde cae (la panza de la curva)."
  },
  {
   "id": "r158",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8624,
   "src": "M_max :=\n    m := 0\n    for i in 1:n_curva\n        if curva[i,1] > m\n            m := curva[i,1]\n    return m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r159",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8752,
   "src": "Rd_Mmax := M_max*1 tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r160",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8800,
   "src": "En la curva NOMINAL el máximo es el balanceado; en la de DISEÑO se corre abajo,"
  },
  {
   "id": "r161",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8848,
   "src": "porque al pasar el balanceado φ empieza a subir."
  },
  {
   "id": "v015",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8896,
   "src": "Rd_Mmax > Rd_Mb ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r163",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8960,
   "src": "━━ 10 · LAS COMBINACIONES CONTRA LA FRONTERA (10.5.1.1) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r164",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9008,
   "src": "Demanda declarada: dos combinaciones del análisis, dato de entrada del ejemplo."
  },
  {
   "id": "r165",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9056,
   "src": "P_u1 := 260 tonf"
  },
  {
   "id": "r166",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9104,
   "src": "M_u1 := 12 tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r167",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9152,
   "src": "P_u2 := 70 tonf"
  },
  {
   "id": "r168",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9200,
   "src": "M_u2 := 28 tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r169",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9248,
   "src": "r_axial := P_u1/P_u2 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r170",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9296,
   "src": "10.5.1.1(a): φP_n ≥ P_u, con el tope de 22.4.2.1 como techo axial."
  },
  {
   "id": "r171",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9344,
   "src": "u_P1 := P_u1/Rd_P ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r172",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9392,
   "src": "u_P2 := P_u2/Rd_P ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r173",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9440,
   "src": "10.5.1.1(b): la capacidad a momento se lee en la frontera al nivel de axial de"
  },
  {
   "id": "r174",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9488,
   "src": "cada combinación. Se busca por bisección el c cuyo φP_n iguala el P_u."
  },
  {
   "id": "r175",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9536,
   "src": "c_de_P(P_obj) :=\n    lo := c_0\n    hi := c_fin\n    for i in 1:60\n        mid := (lo + hi)/2\n        if phi_c(mid)*P_n(mid) > P_obj\n            hi := mid\n        else\n            lo := mid\n    return (lo + hi)/2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r176",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9744,
   "src": "c_1 := c_de_P(P_u1) = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r177",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9792,
   "src": "phi_1 := phi_c(c_1) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r178",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9840,
   "src": "Rd_M1 := phi_1*M_n(c_1) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r179",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9888,
   "src": "u_1 := M_u1/Rd_M1 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r180",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9936,
   "src": "c_2 := c_de_P(P_u2) = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r181",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9984,
   "src": "eps_t2 := eps_t(c_2) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r182",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10032,
   "src": "phi_tab2 := phi_tab(c_2) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r183",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10080,
   "src": "phi_lim2 := phi_lim(P_n(c_2)) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r184",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10128,
   "src": "Cuál de los dos manda el φ de C2: el de la tabla o el tope de 21.2.2.3."
  },
  {
   "id": "r185",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10176,
   "src": "c_2123_manda := phi_lim2 < phi_tab2 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r186",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10224,
   "src": "phi_2 := phi_c(c_2) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r187",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10272,
   "src": "Rd_M2 := phi_2*M_n(c_2) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r188",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10320,
   "src": "u_2 := M_u2/Rd_M2 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r189",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10368,
   "src": "La distancia a la frontera de la que gobierna, que es lo que el diagrama muestra."
  },
  {
   "id": "r190",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10416,
   "src": "margen_2 := Rd_M2 - M_u2 = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r191",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10464,
   "src": "margen_1 := Rd_M1 - M_u1 = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r192",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10528,
   "src": "━━ 11 · ESBELTEZ (6.2.5) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r193",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10576,
   "src": "l_u := 3.0 m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r194",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10624,
   "src": "Pórtico arriostrado por los muros: k = 1,0 (R6.2.5.1 lo admite como primera"
  },
  {
   "id": "r195",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10672,
   "src": "aproximación en la Ec. 6.2.5.1b)."
  },
  {
   "id": "r196",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10720,
   "src": "k_col := 1.0"
  },
  {
   "id": "r197",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10768,
   "src": "6.2.5.2(b): r = 0,30·h en la dirección considerada, para columna rectangular."
  },
  {
   "id": "r198",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10816,
   "src": "r_gyr := 0.30*h = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r199",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10864,
   "src": "lambda_col := k_col*l_u/r_gyr ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r200",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10912,
   "src": "6.2.5.1(b): el cociente M_1/M_2 es NEGATIVO en curvatura simple (318-14 en"
  },
  {
   "id": "r201",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 10960,
   "src": "adelante invirtió el signo: la ecuación es 34 + 12(M_1/M_2), no 34 − 12(M_1/M_2))."
  },
  {
   "id": "r202",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11008,
   "src": "rel_M := -0.5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r203",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11056,
   "src": "lim_b := 34 + 12*rel_M ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r204",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11104,
   "src": "6.2.5.1(c): y además el cociente no puede pasar de 40. Las dos condiciones van"
  },
  {
   "id": "r205",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11152,
   "src": "unidas por «and»: la que manda es la menor."
  },
  {
   "id": "r206",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11200,
   "src": "lim_c := 40"
  },
  {
   "id": "r207",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11248,
   "src": "lim_esb := min(lim_b, lim_c) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v016",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11296,
   "src": "lambda_col <= lim_esb ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r209",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11344,
   "src": "6.2.5.3: si no se cumpliera, no baja la frontera — amplifica la demanda M_u."
  },
  {
   "id": "r210",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11408,
   "src": "━━ 12 · QUÉ GOBIERNA ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r211",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11456,
   "src": "u_max := max(u_P1, u_1, u_2) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r212",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11504,
   "src": "gobierna :=\n    if u_max == u_2\n        return \"flexocompresión C2 (0,9D+E), rama baja\"\n    else if u_max == u_1\n        return \"flexocompresión C1 (1,2D+1,6L)\"\n    else\n        return \"axial máximo, tope de 22.4.2.1\""
  },
  {
   "id": "v017",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11664,
   "src": "u_max <= 1 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r214",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11728,
   "src": "━━ 13 · EL DIAGRAMA ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r215",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11776,
   "src": "El mapeo a píxeles lo hace la hoja, no el motor: así la escala y el sentido de"
  },
  {
   "id": "r216",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11824,
   "src": "los ejes quedan a la vista. Origen del diagrama en (x_0, y_0), el eje P hacia"
  },
  {
   "id": "r217",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11872,
   "src": "arriba (por eso y_px resta) y el eje M hacia la derecha."
  },
  {
   "id": "r218",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11920,
   "src": "x_0 := 70"
  },
  {
   "id": "r219",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 11968,
   "src": "y_0 := 360"
  },
  {
   "id": "r220",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12016,
   "src": "M_esc := 50 tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r221",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12064,
   "src": "P_esc := 400 tonf"
  },
  {
   "id": "r222",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12112,
   "src": "w_dib := 400"
  },
  {
   "id": "r223",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12160,
   "src": "h_dib := 290"
  },
  {
   "id": "r224",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12208,
   "src": "s_M := w_dib/(M_esc/(1 tonf*m))"
  },
  {
   "id": "r225",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12256,
   "src": "s_P := h_dib/(P_esc/(1 tonf))"
  },
  {
   "id": "r226",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12304,
   "src": "x_px(Md) := x_0 + Md/(1 tonf*m)*s_M"
  },
  {
   "id": "r227",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12336,
   "src": "y_px(Pd) := y_0 - Pd/(1 tonf)*s_P"
  },
  {
   "id": "r228",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12368,
   "src": "curva_px :=\n    acc := [[0, 0]]\n    for i in 1:n_curva\n        acc := concat(acc, [[x_0 + curva[i,1]*s_M, y_0 - curva[i,2]*s_P]], 1)\n    return acc[2:end, 1:2]"
  },
  {
   "id": "r229",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12480,
   "src": "Las tres anclas y las dos combinaciones, en píxeles."
  },
  {
   "id": "r230",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12528,
   "src": "xa_1 := x_px(0 tonf*m)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r231",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12576,
   "src": "ya_1 := y_px(Rd_P)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r232",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12624,
   "src": "xa_2 := x_px(Rd_Mb)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r233",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12672,
   "src": "ya_2 := y_px(Rd_Pb)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r234",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12720,
   "src": "xa_3 := x_px(Rd_M0)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r235",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12768,
   "src": "ya_3 := y_px(0 tonf)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r236",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12816,
   "src": "xc_1 := x_px(M_u1)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r237",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12864,
   "src": "yc_1 := y_px(P_u1)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r238",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12912,
   "src": "xc_2 := x_px(M_u2)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r239",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 12960,
   "src": "yc_2 := y_px(P_u2)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r240",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 13008,
   "src": "Y el segmento que mide la distancia de C2 a la frontera, sobre su nivel de axial."
  },
  {
   "id": "r241",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 13056,
   "src": "xf_2 := x_px(Rd_M2)"
  },
